I'm wrapping up the git-blame check of `src/` and `tests/`, and here are the results.

I ran `git blame` (ignoring whitespace, following moves) on every PHP file. I did this instead of relying on the busfactor script's output, which counts commits and doesn't reflect the lines that survive today. I applied the repo's `.mailmap`, so `<email redacted>` and `<email redacted>` are one person.

